                     FreePascalOS firmware files
                     ===========================

This folder holds firmware that devices load into themselves: code that
runs on the device's own processor, not in FreePascalOS. It is laid out
as the linux-firmware repository is
(https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/firmware/linux-firmware.git),
from which these files are copied unmodified (release 20260916). Each
entry below says which driver uses the files and under which licence
they may be distributed; the licence files sit beside this one.

The firmware is not part of FreePascalOS's own source and is not covered
by its GNU General Public License: it is distributed alongside it, under
its vendors' terms. `make system-disk` installs this folder, licences
included, as /lib/firmware.

